Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] Preserve and uniformly scale original title art on PC GPU

The PC GPU path keeps the original animated background and original title/logo
sprites. It uniformly scales the original title composition to reserve space
for the native-resolution prompt/menu; only the vanilla menu and footer sprites
are replaced. Switch and SDL3 GL retain their original draw path.

--- a/src/menus/title/logo.c
+++ b/src/menus/title/logo.c
@@ -12,0 +13,5 @@
+#if defined(DW3_PC_SDL3_GPU)
+        sprite.setScale((ONE * 21) / 25, (ONE * 21) / 25, ONE);
+        sprite.setPivot(157, -23);
+#endif
